      "message": "This is using different criteria from below. See the logic for fulfilled.\nhttp://google3/third_party/java_src/gerritcodereview/gerrit/java/com/google/gerrit/entities/SubmitRequirementResult.java?q\u003dsymbol%3A%5Cbcom.google.gerrit.entities.SubmitRequirementResult.fulfilled%5Cb%20case%3Ayes\n\nNot saying one is better than the other, but could use an explanation of why you picked each and why it\u0027s different in each case.",
